## `true` si el tipo es un primitivo.
##
## ## Memoria
## O(1), no asigna.
weave is_base with t as ref to SemaTypeTable, id as int into bool:
    return (calling at with t, id).kind == tk.SemaTypeKind.TkBase

## `true` si el tipo es `TkError`.
##
## ## Memoria
## O(1), no asigna.
weave is_error with t as ref to SemaTypeTable, id as int into bool:
    return id <= 0 or (calling at with t, id).kind == tk.SemaTypeKind.TkError
